# 📝 SUMMARY OF WHAT WE’VE DONE

### 1️⃣ **Project Setup**

* Created a **Blazor WebAssembly project** in `frontend` folder.
* Ensured `.csproj` targets **.NET 10** and includes `Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.WebAssembly`.
* Clean folder structure:

```
AIStudyAssistant/
    frontend/          ← Blazor WASM frontend
    backend/           ← Node/Express backend (planned)
```

---

### 2️⃣ **Namespace & Imports Fixed**

* Set project namespace to `frontend`.
* `_Imports.razor` updated to:

```razor
@using System.Net.Http
@using System.Net.Http.Json
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Forms
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Routing
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web.Virtualization
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.WebAssembly.Http
@using Microsoft.JSInterop

@using frontend.Components
@using frontend.Shared
```

* Deleted invalid `@using frontend` and `@using AIStudyAssistant`.

---

### 3️⃣ **Layouts Restored**

* Recreated **MainLayout.razor** with:

```razor
@* Main layout for all pages with Navbar, Body, and Footer *@
<div class="main-layout">
    <NavbarComponent />
    <main class="content">
        @Body
    </main>
    <Footer />
</div>
```

* `MainLayout.razor.css` added for **dark background, spacing, and responsive styling**.

---

### 4️⃣ **Components Added**

* **NavbarComponent**: Top navigation with links.

* **FooterComponent**: Footer placeholder.

* **HeroSection**: First landing page section with:

  * Headline + subheadline
  * CTA buttons
  * Floating hero image with **fade-in & float animations**

* **Folder structure for components**:

```
frontend/
    Components/
        NavbarComponent.razor
        Footer.razor
        HeroSection.razor
    Shared/
        MainLayout.razor
```

---

### 5️⃣ **App.razor Fixed**

* `App.razor` now uses:

```razor
<Router AppAssembly="@typeof(Program).Assembly">
    <Found Context="routeData">
        <RouteView RouteData="@routeData" DefaultLayout="@typeof(MainLayout)" />
    </Found>
    <NotFound>
        <LayoutView Layout="@typeof(MainLayout)">
            <p>Sorry, the page could not be found.</p>
        </LayoutView>
    </NotFound>
</Router>
```

* Ensures **all pages use MainLayout**.

---

### 6️⃣ **CSS & Animations**

* Hero section motion:

  * Fade-in content
  * Floating hero image (up/down with CSS `@keyframes float`)
* CTA button hover effects: scale + glowing shadow
* Fully responsive for mobile (flex direction column, scaling images)

---

